  "description": "Running boards were originally designed to protect vehicles from lower body damage, but they have evolved to serve other purposes as well. Many truck and SUV owners want Nerf bars just for the way they look — these sleek, tubular side bars make a stylish statement on almost any rig. These Nerf bars also function as side steps, creating an easier and safer entry point into the truck / SUV.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab Pickup 4-Door (For New Body Style ONLY)\nWill NOT Fit 2019-2026 Classic Body Style\nWill NOT Fit 2018 Previous Generation Build in 2019\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - This running board side step is compatible with the 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 Crew Cab. (Will NOT Fit 2019-2024 Classic Body Style - 2018 Previous Generation Build in 2019)\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - 6\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides a textured surface for excellent footing. Each side can support up to 450 lb\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and durability. The 6-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy movement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb. capacity)\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with rust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures excellent performance and looks for years to come\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required. All factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to factory mount in less than an hour\nProfessional installation recommended",
